# Keep LF in the repository and in every working tree. Containers execute the
# shell scripts under docker/ directly, and a CRLF checkout on Windows would
# break them (bash: /docker-entrypoint-initdb.d/x.sh: bad interpreter).
# 仓库和工作树统一使用 LF。容器会直接执行 docker/ 下的 shell 脚本，Windows 上
# clone 出 CRLF 会让它们启动失败（bash: bad interpreter）。
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
